# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated scene output (ADR-0006 asset export, Task V6 persistence)
#
# Both land in Application.persistentDataPath — outside the repository on every
# platform — so nothing generated normally reaches the working tree. These are
# guards for the case where someone points FurnitureAssetExporter.TryExportOne
# or the Viewer's save path at somewhere inside the repo while testing, which
# both will happily accept.
#
# Deliberately NOT a blanket *.glb rule. Plan section 25's Stretch 1 adds an
# authored furniture model library, and those assets must be committed; a rule
# on the file type would silently drop them the day they arrive. Ignore the
# generated output directory, never the format.
#
# Partial writes are already covered by *.tmp above.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ghostmap-assets/
ghostmap-assets.meta
ghostmap-scene.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-machine Unity editor state
#
# PackageManagerSettings.asset records scoped-registry panel state for whoever
# opened the project, not project configuration. Unity regenerates it on first
# open, so it is untracked here and in apps/scanner (which has been opened on
# macOS) — ignoring it keeps it from churning between the two machines.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/ProjectSettings/PackageManagerSettings.asset
